<title>USA: BellSouth unit names new Europe/Asia head.</title>
<headline>BellSouth unit names new Europe/Asia head.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>BellSouth International, a subsidiary of BellSouth Corp, on Wednesday named Ben Holcomb its president for Europe and Asia-Pacific.</p>
<p>Holcomb, a BellSouth Corp elected officer, currently is president of another BellSouth subsidiary, American Cellular Communications. His appointment to the newly created position at BellSouth International begins February 1.</p>
